<title>FINLAND: Finnish Dec industrial production up 8.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Dec industrial production up 8.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 8.8 percent year-on-year in December compared to a 7.2 percent rise in November, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In 1996, industrial production rose 3.4 percent over 1995, it said.</p>
<p>		   Dec 1996   Nov 1996   Dec 1995</p>
<p>		   +8.8 pct    +7.2 pct   +5.0 pct</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 6.9 percent (range 6.0-7.6 pct).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 292</p>
